#describe what A pull-request guide of one to eight steps, each owning hunks, can be validated, written as record lines, parsed back and checked for coverage.
#describe before A record had no guide.
#describe after A record may carry guide lines; a malformed guide fails the record and a record without one stays valid.
#describe verified The guide test, the full test suite and the typecheck pass.
#plan guided-pr-review s1.1
