#order skills/lantern-setup/references/format.md
#order test/lantern-pr-guide.test.ts
#reason skills/lantern-setup/scripts/prguide.mjs The guide needs one place that owns its limits, its record grammar and the check that every hunk belongs to one step.
#reason test/lantern-pr-guide.test.ts Pins the round trip, each limit and the missed and doubled hunk reports before later items build on them.
#reason skills/lantern-setup/references/format.md The guide lines and their limits are part of the record format, so readers and writers share one written grammar.
#reason skills/lantern-setup/scripts/prs.mjs A malformed guide has to fail a record the way a malformed flow does, so the reader never shows a broken guide.
#story A pull request carries a guide
#step actor Author of a pull request
#file skills/lantern-setup/scripts/prguide.mjs
#step action writes a guide of ordered steps for
#step subject the reviewer reading it
#below actor Reviewer
#below interaction can read the change step by step
